query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% NY N351827 (May 2026): a 3-in-1 men's jacket from Bangladesh.
% CBP: the outer jacket of style HJ222 -> 6210.20; the inner jacket of style HJ222 -> 6101.30
scenario ny_n351827 is, as stated in ruling NY N351827:
    % each jacket of the 3-in-1 style is classified as a separate garment
    the kind of the outer jacket of style HJ222 is jacket,
        confer "It is composed of two men’s hip-length jackets".
    the cut of the outer jacket of style HJ222 indicates men,
        confer "It is composed of two men’s hip-length jackets".
    the fabric construction of the outer jacket of style HJ222 is woven,
        confer "The outer jacket is composed of 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the outer jacket of style HJ222 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The outer jacket is composed of 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the outer jacket of style HJ222 is made up of fabric of heading 5903,
        confer "woven fabric with a visible polyurethane coating on the inner surface".
    the kind of the inner jacket of style HJ222 is jacket,
        confer "It is composed of two men’s hip-length jackets".
    the cut of the inner jacket of style HJ222 indicates men,
        confer "It is composed of two men’s hip-length jackets".
    % the inner jacket is a woven fabric (92% polyester 8% elastane) bonded to a
    % 100% polyester knit pile fabric, which CBP holds remains a knit pile fabric
    % of heading 6001: construction and composition of the knit pile fabric
    the fabric construction of the inner jacket of style HJ222 is knitted,
        confer "The brushed knit fabric for the inner jacket was analyzed by the CBP laboratory and found to be of weft knit pile construction".
    the inner jacket of style HJ222 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "bonded to a 100% polyester brushed knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the outer jacket of style HJ222 is 6210.20", "the subheading of the inner jacket of style HJ222 is 6101.30"].

