    the cut of style 20063 indicates men,
        confer "Style 20063 is a men’s jacket constructed from 90% polyester, and 10% spandex knit fabric".
    the fabric construction of style 20063 is knitted,
        confer "90% polyester, and 10% spandex knit fabric that is brushed on the inside surface".
    style 20063 contains 90 percent of polyester,
        confer "constructed from 90% polyester, and 10% spandex knit fabric".
    style 20063 contains 10 percent of spandex,
        confer "constructed from 90% polyester, and 10% spandex knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 20069 is 6101.30", "the subheading of style 20077 is 6102.30", "the subheading of style 20063 is 6101.30"].

