% NY N344557 (January 2025): a men's upper body garment from China.
% CBP: style THM80274 -> 6103.32
scenario ny_n344557 is, as stated in ruling NY N344557:
    % DISAGREES: CBP gives 6103.32 (suit-type jacket); the model gives
    % 6110.20 — the ruling calls the garment an upper body garment (a top)
    % and never a jacket; its features (four panels, collar, full front
    % opening) are those CBP reads as a suit-type jacket's.
    % the ruling calls the garment only an upper body garment (its code is that
    % of suit-type jackets): recorded as an upper body garment
    style THM80274 is an upper body garment,
        confer "Style THM80274 is a men’s upper body garment constructed from 70% cotton, 26% nylon, and 4% spandex knit fabric".
    style THM80274 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style THM80274 is knitted,
        confer "constructed from 70% cotton, 26% nylon, and 4% spandex knit fabric".
    the cut of style THM80274 indicates men,
        confer "Style THM80274 is a men’s upper body garment".
    style THM80274 contains 70 percent of cotton,
        confer "constructed from 70% cotton, 26% nylon, and 4% spandex knit fabric".
    style THM80274 contains 26 percent of nylon,
        confer "constructed from 70% cotton, 26% nylon, and 4% spandex knit fabric".
    style THM80274 contains 4 percent of spandex,
        confer "constructed from 70% cotton, 26% nylon, and 4% spandex knit fabric".
    style THM80274 has at least four panels in its outer shell,
        confer "Style THM80274 is constructed from four panels sewn together lengthwise".
    style THM80274 has a collar,
        confer "features a self-fabric spread collar".
    style THM80274 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "a left-over-right, full front opening with four button closures".
    style THM80274 closes left over right,
        confer "a left-over-right, full front opening with four button closures".
    style THM80274 has pockets below the waist,
        confer "a vertical inset pocket on each front panel below the waist".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style THM80274 is 6110.20"].

