% NY N328346 (October 2022): pajamas from India.
% CBP: item 724361001 -> 6207.21; item 824361001 -> 6107.21
scenario ny_n328346 is, as stated in ruling NY N328346:
    the essential character of item 724361001 is given by no single component,
        according to CBP, confer "As each is equally essential, classification must be based upon GRI 3(c)".
    % item 724361001: a knit top and woven bottoms; CBP finds that neither
    % imparts the essential character and applies GRI 3(c)
    the kind of item 724361001 is pajamas,
        confer "Item 724361001 is a pair of men’s pajamas".
    the cut of item 724361001 indicates men,
        confer "Item 724361001 is a pair of men’s pajamas".
    item 724361001 is a set put up for retail sale,
        confer "The garments will be flat folded and secured in a belly band with a ribbon threaded through a cardboard band in the center".
    the top of item 724361001 is a component of item 724361001,
